{
    "name": "§aTuco Salamanca",
    "entityType": "easy_npc:humanoid",
    "description": "A high-ranking cartel enforcer, volatile and violent.",
    "skin": {
        "type": "CUSTOM",
        "textureId": "Tuco_Salamanca_39fb1585"
    },
    "attributes": {
        "maxHealth": 40,
        "movementSpeed": 0.3,
        "invulnerable": false,
        "attackableByPlayers": true,
        "attackableByMonsters": true,
        "nameVisibility": "NEVER"
    },
    "objectives": {
        "wanderRange": 50.0,
        "attackHostileMobs": true,
        "attackPlayers": false,
        "returnToSpawn": false
    },
    "dialogs": {
        "main": {
            "greeting": "嘿，朋友！你看起来是个精神饱满的家伙。Tuco Salamanca喜欢有活力的人，就像你一样。告诉我，你有什么好货要给我看看吗？还是说，你想为Tuco工作？",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "我有你要的东西",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_1",
                    "id": "btn_offer"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我只是路过",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:story_2",
                    "id": "btn_pass"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_1": {
            "greeting": "哦，真的吗？这太棒了！Tuco喜欢有胆量的人。但是记住，如果你敢耍花招，我会把你的头放进搅拌机里搅碎。货在哪里？快点拿出来！",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "这是样品，品质一流",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:conclusion_1",
                    "id": "btn_sample"
                },
                {
                    "label": "货不在我身上",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:conclusion_2",
                    "id": "btn_not_here"
                }
            ]
        },
        "story_2": {
            "greeting": "路过？Tuco不相信巧合。你看起来像个条子，或者是个想偷我生意的混蛋。解释清楚，不然我就让你尝尝我的'特殊招待'！",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "我真的只是迷路了",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:conclusion_3",
                    "id": "btn_lie"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我是新来的，想找个机会",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:conclusion_4",
                    "id": "btn_newbie"
                }
            ]
        },
        "conclusion_1": {
            "greeting": "很好！这纯度...这质量...太棒了！Tuco很满意。我们今晚就交易。带上你的货，来那个废弃的仓库。别迟到，也别带朋友来。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "成交，晚上见",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_deal"
                }
            ]
        },
        "conclusion_2": {
            "greeting": "什么？你在耍我吗？Tuco最恨别人耍他！我会找到你的，我会把你的牙齿一颗颗敲下来，让你知道欺骗我的下场！滚！",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "对不起，我马上去拿",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_run"
                }
            ]
        },
        "conclusion_3": {
            "greeting": "迷路？哼，好吧，这次饶了你。但别再让Tuco看到你在这里晃悠。这片地盘是我的，懂吗？现在，滚吧！",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "是，是，我这就走",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_leave"
                }
            ]
        },
        "conclusion_4": {
            "greeting": "新来的？嗯...你看起来还算机灵。Tuco正好缺个跑腿的。如果你表现好，也许能赚点钱。但如果你搞砸了...你知道下场的。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "我会证明我的价值",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_prove"
                }
            ]
        }
    },
    "pose": "STANDING",
    "drop": {
        "item": {
            "item": "numismatic-overhaul:bronze_coin,numismatic-overhaul:silver_coin",
            "count": 15
        },
        "minCount": 15,
        "maxCount": 30,
        "chance": 0.5,
        "playerKillOnly": true
    }
}